OL,3,ATheresa May 'aghast' at Burnham's EU
OL,4,Aplans and says 'Brexit is done'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMay claimed Burnham "wants to pat
OL,7,Fpeople on the head" by suggesting:
OL,8,F"Remember that vote? Well, you got it
OL,9,Fwrong, didn't you. So have another go
OL,10,Fand come out with the right answer."
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
